## 6. How to handle your 60-day notice period

This is one area I would address proactively.

Some recruiters prefer candidates who can join immediately or within 30 days.

My suggestions:

- Mention your actual 60-day notice period.
- If your company permits early release, mention that early release may be negotiable.
- Discuss buyout options only if your employer allows them.
- Don't promise a 30-day joining date unless you can genuinely achieve it.

You can tell recruiters:

Writing

Hi,

I have 10 years of experience in .NET development, with 3–5 years of hands-on AWS experience and exposure to DevOps practices.

I am exploring Senior .NET + AWS Cloud Engineer opportunities.

My official notice period is 60 days, with early release subject to company approval.

My preferred locations are Bangalore, Hyderabad, Pune and Noida.

Please let me know if you have any suitable opportunities.

Thanks.

