## 8. Interview preparation roadmap

For a 10-year experienced candidate, interviewers will expect more than basic coding.

| Topic | What to prepare |
| --- | --- |
| C# | Async/await, LINQ, delegates, garbage collection |
| .NET Core | Middleware, dependency injection, performance |
| Web API | Authentication, JWT, exception handling |
| Architecture | Microservices, design patterns, system design |
| SQL | Indexing, joins, query optimization |
| AWS | EC2, S3, Lambda, RDS, IAM, VPC |
| DevOps | CI/CD, Docker, Kubernetes, deployment |
| System design | Scalable applications, caching, messaging |

Spend extra time preparing one real project where you can explain the complete journey:

.NET application → Docker → CI/CD pipeline → AWS deployment → monitoring.

Be ready to explain your own architecture, decisions, challenges and production issues.

